## Localized entity names — appLabel(), never a literal

`appLabel(key)` from '@/i18n' returns the entity name in the ACTIVE language.
These are ALL the keys; the names are shown for orientation only:

  appLabel('belegungskalender')  →  Belegungskalender
  appLabel('buchungsanfrage')    →  Buchungsanfrage

WRONG: `title="Belegungskalender"` — and equally wrong: a local helper that returns
       that literal behind an `i18n-exempt` marker. Gate 21 and the mechanical
       healer both SKIP that marker, so the label stays frozen in one language
       and NOTHING reports it.
RIGHT: `title={appLabel('belegungskalender')}`

